  },
  data: {
    LLM: "Before the deal each player posts an agreed ante. Dealer deals five cards face down to each player. First betting round starts with the player to dealer's left. If more than one player remains, the draw: each active player in turn (from dealer's left) may discard 0 to 3 cards face down and receive that many replacements from the stock (standing pat means discard zero). Second betting round, opened by the opener of the first round; stakes often double. Showdown: best five-card hand wins; five aces (A-A-A-A-Bug) is highest. If everyone checks in the first round, hands are thrown in, deal passes left, everyone antes again.",
    Player: "Before the deal each player posts an agreed ante. Dealer deals five cards face down to each player. First betting round starts with the player to dealer's left. If more than one player remains, the draw: each active player in turn (from dealer's left) may discard 0 to 3 cards face down and receive that many replacements from the stock (standing pat means discard zero). Second betting round, opened by the opener of the first round; stakes often double. Showdown: best five-card hand wins; five aces (A-A-A-A-Bug) is highest. If everyone checks in the first round, hands are thrown in, deal passes left, everyone antes again.",
    objective: 'Best hand. Bug is Ace or straight flush filler only.',
    gameplay: "Before the deal each player posts an agreed ante. Dealer deals five cards face down to each player. First betting round starts with the player to dealer's left. If more than one player remains, the draw: each active player in turn (from dealer's left) may discard 0 to 3 cards face down and receive that many replacements from the stock (standing pat means discard zero). Second betting round, opened by the opener of the first round; stakes often double. Showdown: best five-card hand wins; five aces (A-A-A-A-Bug) is highest. If everyone checks in the first round, hands are thrown in, deal passes left, everyone antes again.",
    keyRules: [
      'Bug limited wild',
